1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,640
All depicted events are fictional

2
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:06,880
and for entertainment purposes only.
Viewer discretion is advised.

3
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:21,560
Whither do you think to flee?

4
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:26,800
-What?
-I had a nightmare.

5
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:29,320
Tonight, might you share my bed?

6
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:28,480
<i>Why is my heart beating faster</i>
<i>than it did in the nightmare?</i>

7
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,040
You…

8
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:52,600
Is it for me?

9
00:03:14,640 --> 00:03:15,600
It's so sweet.

10
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:17,240
Palm wine.

11
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:19,920
Fermented with palm sugar.

12
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:22,040
Its effect is quite mild,

13
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,960
ensuring that one
will not suffer a headache.

14
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:29,840
Strange.

15
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:32,800
You're usually

16
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:35,760
pretty against me
drinking alcohol.

17
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,800
You have been troubled.

18
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,520
Here with me,

19
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:42,760
no harm shall come to you.

20
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,560
Drink just enough,

21
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:49,000
so that you may rest without dreams.

22
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:07,240
The reason Klao…

23
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:10,880
I mean,

24
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,760
the reason I started drinking heavily

25
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:15,600
might be because

26
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:18,360
I wanted to sleep without dreaming.

27
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:36,640
You must have been very troubled.

28
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:39,360
Was the nightmare you were having,

29
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:42,240
related to your father again?

30
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:54,920
Yeah, kind of.

31
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:57,560
I…

32
00:04:58,200 --> 00:04:59,680
I saw Cherd in my dream.

33
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:03,080
I saw him

34
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:06,200
trying to hurt me.

35
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:15,160
When you fell ill before,

36
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:19,840
I saw you plagued by a nightmare
in your sleep.

37
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,640
I know this is painful for you,

38
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:26,120
but the more you dwell on
the truth about your father,

39
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:29,960
the greater the toll it takes
on your mind and body.

40
00:05:31,280 --> 00:05:32,840
I worry for you greatly.

41
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:42,120
Leave the past behind,

42
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:46,280
and let me be the one to fill your present

43
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:47,960
with joy without end.

44
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,440
<i>Come on!</i>

45
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:02,160
<i>You freaking microwave.</i>

46
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,920
<i>No,</i>

47
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:07,840
<i>in this era, he's more like</i>

48
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:10,680
<i>a charcoal stove.</i>

49
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:14,880
<i>Stop it!</i>

50
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:16,920
<i>Don't get too invested now.</i>

51
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:19,800
<i>The one he cares about is Klao,</i>
<i>not you, Nakun.</i>

52
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:27,280
May I…

53
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:32,920
ask you something, Phop?

54
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:36,120
Are you…

55
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:38,400
more worried about me

56
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,080
or

57
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:43,040
Klao, the one you knew?

58
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,720
What is it you are implying?

59
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:57,680
I mean…

60
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:01,000
<i>I'm not the real Klao.</i>

61
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:03,600
<i>This is your chance, Nakun.</i>

62
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:05,600
<i>It's time to tell him the truth.</i>

63
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:20,000
You are Klao,
the one I once knew, are you not?

64
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,800
Though you speak strangely

65
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,520
and act somewhat recklessly,

66
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:41,920
unlike your former self,

67
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:46,400
and though
I sometimes see you smile and laugh,

68
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:50,040
my concern for you remains unchanged.

69
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:10,520
I believe you know in your heart
well enough

70
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:14,200
how I feel about you.

71
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,480
Hold it.

72
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,320
Are you drunk?

73
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:08,520
<i>Gosh, you're such a green flag,</i>

74
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:10,400
<i>a very bright green at that.</i>

75
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,560
<i>He even asked for consent</i>
<i>before kissing me.</i>

76
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:15,720
<i>Wait.</i>

77
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:16,640
<i>A kiss!</i>

78
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:27,040
Dawn is fast approaching, you see.

79
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,000
I think…

80
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:31,600
I should hit the hay now,

81
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:33,560
or I'll be too tired

82
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,240
for tomorrow's festivities.

83
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:38,480
Klao,

84
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:40,280
are you displeased with me?

85
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:43,520
No.

86
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:45,240
I'm pleased with you,

87
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,760
I really am,

88
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,080
but…

89
00:09:48,160 --> 00:09:50,080
I'm getting really sleepy.

90
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:56,440
I'd better go to sleep.

91
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,400
Goodnight and no dreams, Phop.

92
00:10:12,680 --> 00:10:13,600
<i>That was close.</i>

93
00:10:14,160 --> 00:10:15,480
<i>Too close.</i>

94
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:18,320
<i>Things almost escalated.</i>

95
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:23,920
<i>Fortunately,</i>

96
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,160
<i>nobody saw us.</i>

97
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:29,200
<i>Or I would've been flustered</i>
<i>even into my next life.</i>

98
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:47,480
<i>But why just a kiss on the cheek?</i>

99
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:50,120
<i>Is it because he still loves</i>
<i>the real Klao?</i>

100
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,280
<i>No.</i>

101
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:56,960
<i>It's like that famous period drama</i>
<i>that just came out.</i>

102
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:59,240
<i>Mom says Thais usually</i>
<i>didn't kiss on the lips.</i>

103
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:01,600
<i>That's what Westerners do.</i>

104
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:05,880
<i>This means…</i>

105
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:07,960
<i>he actually loves me?</i>

106
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,840
<i>His gaze…</i>

107
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:12,920
<i>His voice…</i>

108
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,560
<i>A kiss.</i>

109
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:17,520
<i>And tomorrow, we're going on a date.</i>

110
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:20,000
<i>So people in the past can be</i>
<i>this romantic?</i>

111
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:22,320
<i>This place isn't that bad</i>
<i>after all, is it?</i>

112
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:24,800
<i>You fool!</i>

113
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:25,920
<i>Nakun!</i>

114
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:28,120
<i>You can't stay here because of him.</i>

115
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,680
<i>You have classes to attend.</i>

116
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:30,960
<i>Thee is waiting for you.</i>

117
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:32,280
<i>So is Pun.</i>

118
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,560
<i>And…</i>

119
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:35,320
<i>Mom.</i>

120
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:44,080
This many dishes?

121
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:46,360
You want me to be full
until next semester?

122
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,960
So extra.

123
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:50,800
You've been away from home
for this long,

124
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:53,120
so it's only fair I make it up to you, no?

125
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:54,520
Go ahead and dig in.

126
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,920
This is enough for me.

127
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:01,840
Hey! Wait!

128
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:03,640
What are you doing?

129
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:05,520
There!

130
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,360
Have some more.

131
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,400
Mom…

132
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:11,560
Eat a lot of rice, okay?

133
00:12:11,640 --> 00:12:14,160
You only eat the main dishes.
Look at you.

134
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:17,200
You're all skin and bones.

135
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,440
Eat up, okay?

136
00:12:18,520 --> 00:12:20,600
I'm not that skinny, Mom.

137
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,840
Come on, try this one.

138
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:33,400
Tasty.

139
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:37,240
You cooked this much food for me…

140
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:39,520
You miss me, don't you?

141
00:12:58,520 --> 00:13:01,000
Me being away…

142
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:04,800
makes you feel lonely, doesn't it?

143
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:06,000
What do you mean?

144
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:08,480
I have a lot of friends, all right?

145
00:13:08,560 --> 00:13:11,480
When I get bored,
I just hang out at my friends' places.

146
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:12,760
It's fine.

147
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:23,920
But…

148
00:13:25,520 --> 00:13:27,840
I can't thank you enough

149
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:30,920
for allowing me to study in Bangkok

150
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:37,600
after raising me all by yourself.

151
00:13:38,640 --> 00:13:41,280
You've been both
a father and a mother to me,

152
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:43,800
yet you've never left me feeling lonely.

153
00:13:45,760 --> 00:13:47,040
Honestly,

154
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:49,640
if you want to be with someone else,

155
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,920
I won't mind at all.

156
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:54,800
Gosh!

157
00:13:54,880 --> 00:13:56,080
I won't.

158
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:58,320
That only gives me a headache.

159
00:13:58,400 --> 00:14:01,080
Having you is all I need.

160
00:14:04,400 --> 00:14:05,240
But…

161
00:14:06,640 --> 00:14:08,480
I'm not always

162
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,800
by your side, you know?

163
00:14:11,680 --> 00:14:12,880
You see,

164
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:14,720
after being here for about a month,

165
00:14:14,800 --> 00:14:16,720
I'll have to leave next month.

166
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:19,360
If I'm busy during
any of my school breaks,

167
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:21,880
I won't be able to come home to see you.

168
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:24,240
How would that make you feel?

169
00:14:26,520 --> 00:14:28,960
Listen. I'll be fine.

170
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:33,520
Just call me if you can't make it.

171
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:35,520
Video calling is a thing, you know?

172
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:37,200
It's been around for ages.

173
00:14:37,280 --> 00:14:38,880
Just video call me.

174
00:14:40,800 --> 00:14:41,640
Nakun.

175
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:43,600
Honestly,

176
00:14:44,760 --> 00:14:46,800
I'll be fine. Don't worry about me.

177
00:14:46,880 --> 00:14:48,400
You're all grown up now.

178
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:51,760
Soon, you'll find yourself a partner.

179
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:57,360
Wait… don't tell me you already have one.

180
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:59,040
-Do you have one?
-Gosh, I don't!

181
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:00,800
That only gives me a headache.

182
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:03,200
Having you is all I need.

183
00:15:03,280 --> 00:15:04,760
Sure.

184
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:09,320
Nakun.

185
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:13,080
I'm serious, though.

186
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:17,800
I want you to go out and spread
your wings.

187
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:21,040
Young adulthood

188
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:23,120
doesn't last as long as you think.

189
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:28,120
If you come across something good in life,
seize it, okay?

190
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:32,920
<i>Even if Mom said so…</i>

191
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:35,280
<i>If that's the case,</i>

192
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:37,440
<i>I guess I'll have to stay here</i>

193
00:15:37,520 --> 00:15:38,760
<i>without her.</i>

194
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:42,160
<i>If I want to complete my mission,</i>

195
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:43,600
<i>I'll have to go home</i>

196
00:15:44,400 --> 00:15:45,720
<i>and leave Phop behind.</i>

197
00:15:50,680 --> 00:15:52,240
<i>Even though I love him,</i>

198
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:55,360
<i>it's simply impossible, isn't it?</i>

199
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:15,760
I regret that I have let
so much time slip away like this.

200
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:40,200
I ought not to have fallen for you…

201
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:02,000
I regret having been so harsh toward Kaew.

202
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:23,000
Come on, Nakun! You shouldn't have let
your feelings get involved.

203
00:18:24,800 --> 00:18:27,720
-Did Kaew send you to speak with me?
-I seek only your advice.

204
00:18:53,360 --> 00:18:55,800
-What advice--
-Do you still not speak to him?

205
00:19:12,600 --> 00:19:14,760
What advice are you seeking?

206
00:19:14,840 --> 00:19:16,640
Is there anyone who is unwell?

207
00:19:21,880 --> 00:19:22,720
No.

208
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,520
I simply wonder

209
00:19:26,360 --> 00:19:27,200
how people

210
00:19:27,280 --> 00:19:30,480
go about courting another.

211
00:20:01,520 --> 00:20:03,600
<i>Klao, the one from our childhood?</i>

212
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:04,880
Phop!

213
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:10,040
Are you drawn to men?

214
00:20:11,960 --> 00:20:13,240
Is it that odd?

215
00:20:14,760 --> 00:20:16,680
Are you not the same, or am I mistaken?

216
00:20:22,440 --> 00:20:24,720
It is simply impossible. Phop.

217
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:29,400
The whole capital would be abuzz
with gossip.

218
00:20:29,480 --> 00:20:30,360
Then so be it.

219
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:33,840
I have made my choice.
My heart belonged to Klao

220
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:36,200
from the very beginning.

221
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:39,360
I will pursue him until he is with me.

222
00:20:42,280 --> 00:20:44,440
Pray tell me, my good physician,

223
00:20:44,520 --> 00:20:46,440
what am I to do?

224
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:03,120
If that is your unwavering resolve,

225
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:05,520
it is not my place to interfere.

226
00:21:07,720 --> 00:21:10,120
Listen to me carefully, my friend.

227
00:21:13,520 --> 00:21:15,440
<i>Before you pursue anyone's affection,</i>

228
00:21:15,520 --> 00:21:19,040
<i>you must be certain their heart is free.</i>

229
00:21:19,840 --> 00:21:23,360
<i>Acting in haste to pursue</i>
<i>someone already taken</i>

230
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:26,400
<i>will only hinder your prospects.</i>

231
00:21:34,400 --> 00:21:36,560
What is it you are writing there?

232
00:21:46,520 --> 00:21:49,480
Why have you not yet changed
for the temple festival?

233
00:21:50,520 --> 00:21:51,360
I…

234
00:22:01,480 --> 00:22:03,440
<i>What would give it away?</i>

235
00:22:03,520 --> 00:22:08,680
<i>If he blushes or smiles</i>
<i>when you are near or when you speak,</i>

236
00:22:08,760 --> 00:22:10,320
<i>his heart inclines toward you.</i>

237
00:22:13,080 --> 00:22:14,480
I'm simply…

238
00:22:14,560 --> 00:22:18,320
going over the Khmer and Pali
I've learned.

239
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:20,120
But since I have amnesia,

240
00:22:20,200 --> 00:22:21,840
I haven't translated anything yet.

241
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:27,920
<i>Once certain of their affection,</i>

242
00:22:29,200 --> 00:22:32,640
<i>inquire after their well-being</i>
<i>and offer your help.</i>

243
00:22:32,720 --> 00:22:33,680
"<i>Vihara </i>is

244
00:22:34,560 --> 00:22:35,640
a temple

245
00:22:36,640 --> 00:22:38,120
or an ordination hall."

246
00:22:39,960 --> 00:22:41,160
<i>"Punnotok </i>is

247
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:43,200
a well-supplied

248
00:22:43,280 --> 00:22:44,720
or abundant body of water,

249
00:22:46,600 --> 00:22:47,760
such as

250
00:22:48,600 --> 00:22:50,240
a pool or a pond."

251
00:22:59,840 --> 00:23:01,120
<i>The second period,</i>

252
00:23:01,200 --> 00:23:02,400
<i>a pond,</i>

253
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:04,080
<i>and a temple.</i>
<i>Maybe it's…</i>

254
00:23:16,000 --> 00:23:17,680
Your heart betrays you.

255
00:23:18,280 --> 00:23:20,000
Does my presence stir such feelings?

256
00:23:21,480 --> 00:23:22,560
No.

257
00:23:24,640 --> 00:23:25,520
Oh, Phop.

258
00:23:25,600 --> 00:23:27,280
The temple we're visiting…

259
00:23:28,040 --> 00:23:29,560
is there a pond close to it?

260
00:23:30,760 --> 00:23:32,720
There may be no pond at that temple,

261
00:23:32,800 --> 00:23:34,960
but the temples in the capital

262
00:23:35,040 --> 00:23:37,880
all stand by the water.

263
00:23:51,160 --> 00:23:52,000
Let us go.

264
00:23:57,720 --> 00:23:59,200
I shall change my attire first.

265
00:24:00,800 --> 00:24:02,800
Go on ahead
and wait for me by the dock.

266
00:24:17,240 --> 00:24:19,480
<i>Jom's advice proves most effective.</i>

267
00:24:19,560 --> 00:24:21,760
<i>Klao has expressed a wish to accompany me.</i>

268
00:24:29,760 --> 00:24:30,680
<i>Maybe…</i>

269
00:24:31,320 --> 00:24:33,800
<i>the body of water by the temple</i>
<i>in the second period</i>

270
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:35,600
<i>was Klao's rendezvous point.</i>

271
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:37,040
<i>And he was murdered there.</i>

272
00:24:58,720 --> 00:25:01,160
<i>Though there's a pier,</i>

273
00:25:01,800 --> 00:25:04,160
<i>there isn't a pond</i>
<i>or any other body of water.</i>

274
00:25:04,240 --> 00:25:06,080
<i>If it were just an ordinary canal,</i>

275
00:25:06,160 --> 00:25:09,760
<i>Klao wouldn't have noted it down</i>
<i>in other languages, would he?</i>

276
00:25:16,120 --> 00:25:17,680
Sai, would you like to try that?

277
00:25:17,760 --> 00:25:20,000
Kong, why do you care so much
about my wife?

278
00:25:20,080 --> 00:25:21,200
Sai.

279
00:25:21,280 --> 00:25:22,840
Kong! Keep away from my wife.

280
00:25:22,920 --> 00:25:23,960
Chuay.

281
00:25:25,040 --> 00:25:27,320
You may wander wherever you wish.

282
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:30,040
We shall meet again
before the ordination hall.

283
00:25:30,960 --> 00:25:32,480
-Thanks, my Lord.
-Yes, my Lord.

284
00:25:32,560 --> 00:25:33,520
Sai.

285
00:25:33,600 --> 00:25:35,800
Come, let us build a sand pagoda yonder,

286
00:25:35,880 --> 00:25:37,160
that in the next life

287
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:39,520
we may be united again
as husband and wife.

288
00:25:40,280 --> 00:25:42,520
You need only build half the pagoda, Sai.

289
00:25:42,600 --> 00:25:44,640
Leave the rest for me in the next life.

290
00:25:46,520 --> 00:25:47,480
How does that sound?

291
00:25:47,560 --> 00:25:49,520
Kong! She is my wife.

292
00:25:49,600 --> 00:25:51,800
-I shall go with her.
-Sai, wait for me.

293
00:25:59,760 --> 00:26:00,600
Klao.

294
00:26:02,240 --> 00:26:03,160
What is the matter?

295
00:26:03,840 --> 00:26:05,160
Have you a fever again?

296
00:26:07,360 --> 00:26:08,600
No.

297
00:26:08,680 --> 00:26:10,640
It's a bit hot here.

298
00:26:11,920 --> 00:26:14,800
Let me go and look around real quick.

299
00:26:22,800 --> 00:26:23,680
You.

300
00:26:23,760 --> 00:26:27,280
I heard you had disappeared,
and yet here you are returned?

301
00:26:27,360 --> 00:26:29,440
Oh, yes.

302
00:26:29,520 --> 00:26:31,720
I'm now living together with Phop.

303
00:26:37,800 --> 00:26:38,960
Klao…

304
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:42,880
Only say that you are living with me.

305
00:26:42,960 --> 00:26:44,760
Living together means something else.

306
00:26:52,080 --> 00:26:53,560
I'll take one of these.

307
00:26:54,800 --> 00:26:55,960
Understood.

308
00:26:57,440 --> 00:26:58,640
Here it is.

309
00:27:01,760 --> 00:27:02,840
Thank you kindly.

310
00:27:11,280 --> 00:27:13,040
Come, come.

311
00:27:13,120 --> 00:27:14,400
Come here.

312
00:27:14,480 --> 00:27:15,680
You come here as well.

313
00:27:15,760 --> 00:27:16,600
Goodness!

314
00:27:17,120 --> 00:27:20,080
Look yonder. That man is with another.

315
00:27:20,160 --> 00:27:21,560
This is a belt

316
00:27:21,640 --> 00:27:23,200
of genuine silver.

317
00:27:25,720 --> 00:27:27,440
Do come again.

318
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:31,440
Pray, look around as you wish.

319
00:27:35,920 --> 00:27:37,680
<i>What more is there to be done?</i>

320
00:27:37,760 --> 00:27:39,440
<i>I have shown my care</i>

321
00:27:39,520 --> 00:27:40,920
<i>and offered my assistance.</i>

322
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:42,040
<i>What is left?</i>

323
00:27:42,680 --> 00:27:45,520
<i>In the courtship of a lady,</i>

324
00:27:45,600 --> 00:27:47,120
<i>one gives flowers or ornaments.</i>

325
00:27:47,800 --> 00:27:50,920
<i>With Klao, it is no different.</i>

326
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:53,960
<i>Learn what he likes</i>
<i>and simply buy it for him.</i>

327
00:27:58,280 --> 00:27:59,520
Do you like it?

328
00:28:01,800 --> 00:28:02,760
Of course.

329
00:28:03,320 --> 00:28:05,960
But I think it's very expensive.

330
00:28:06,760 --> 00:28:07,840
I can't afford it.

331
00:28:10,600 --> 00:28:11,880
Might he try this on?

332
00:28:11,960 --> 00:28:13,960
Yes, of course.

333
00:29:11,280 --> 00:29:12,200
It's beautiful.

334
00:29:13,600 --> 00:29:15,240
It's more gorgeous than Cartier's.

335
00:29:18,600 --> 00:29:20,720
If it pleases you, I shall buy it for you.

336
00:29:32,120 --> 00:29:35,200
I'll save up some money
and come back for it later.

337
00:29:35,280 --> 00:29:37,640
Thank you very much, kind merchant.

338
00:29:52,440 --> 00:29:54,640
One day, I shall place this ring

339
00:29:55,560 --> 00:29:57,000
upon your finger, Klao.

340
00:30:03,840 --> 00:30:04,680
<i>It is true.</i>

341
00:30:04,760 --> 00:30:06,600
I saw it with my own eyes.

342
00:30:06,680 --> 00:30:08,800
Last night,
he came out of Lord Phop's room.

343
00:30:08,880 --> 00:30:11,720
This morning,
I saw them embracing by the dock.

344
00:30:11,800 --> 00:30:13,360
And by afternoon,

345
00:30:13,440 --> 00:30:15,680
Lord Phop went again to
Master Klao's room.

346
00:30:17,760 --> 00:30:19,120
So what of it?

347
00:30:19,200 --> 00:30:21,520
They have long been childhood friends.

348
00:30:22,320 --> 00:30:25,160
Sai, this is something
beyond mere friendship.

349
00:30:26,640 --> 00:30:27,880
Are you suggesting that

350
00:30:27,960 --> 00:30:30,200
my master and yours
are in a romantic affair,

351
00:30:30,280 --> 00:30:31,440
-Chuay?
-Goodness.

352
00:30:31,520 --> 00:30:33,400
How could you say such a thing, Kong?

353
00:30:34,640 --> 00:30:35,720
Alas.

354
00:30:38,840 --> 00:30:40,960
Kong, are you so hungry that

355
00:30:41,040 --> 00:30:42,960
you would eat dirt and sand?

356
00:30:43,040 --> 00:30:46,360
I would have prepared something for you,
had you said so.

357
00:30:51,600 --> 00:30:54,000
<i>Maybe there's a pond outside</i>
<i>the temple's vicinity.</i>

358
00:30:54,080 --> 00:30:55,120
<i>What do I do?</i>

359
00:30:55,760 --> 00:30:57,680
<i>How do I go out to look for one?</i>

360
00:30:59,760 --> 00:31:00,600
Klao!

361
00:31:02,640 --> 00:31:03,480
Klao.

362
00:31:05,040 --> 00:31:06,280
How peculiar.

363
00:31:06,360 --> 00:31:08,920
Last night, you were so eager
to come to the festival.

364
00:31:10,040 --> 00:31:12,640
Now that we are here,
why do you seem so indifferent?

365
00:31:19,760 --> 00:31:21,000
What is it that you seek?

366
00:31:23,840 --> 00:31:24,800
Nothing, actually.

367
00:31:24,880 --> 00:31:26,200
My body's just killing me.

368
00:31:34,240 --> 00:31:36,040
If so,

369
00:31:36,120 --> 00:31:38,840
shall we go and watch
the poetry and Choi chanting first?

370
00:31:40,400 --> 00:31:41,920
Since we are here,

371
00:31:42,960 --> 00:31:44,840
it is best we amuse ourselves

372
00:31:46,080 --> 00:31:48,160
so that you may sleep soundly.

373
00:31:56,040 --> 00:31:58,560
<i>Songkran, it is</i>

374
00:31:58,640 --> 00:32:00,840
<i>The festival of joy</i>

375
00:32:00,920 --> 00:32:04,680
<i>Gather around, a most auspicious sign</i>

376
00:32:04,760 --> 00:32:08,800
<i>This family is of great charm</i>

377
00:32:10,000 --> 00:32:11,840
My Lord, this way.

378
00:32:11,920 --> 00:32:13,680
<i>With a beautiful daughter</i>

379
00:32:13,760 --> 00:32:18,240
<i>I wish to be your son-in-law and court her</i>

380
00:32:18,320 --> 00:32:22,200
<i>You are the fairest of them all</i>

381
00:32:22,280 --> 00:32:26,160
<i>Like the moon and stars, I stand in awe</i>

382
00:32:26,760 --> 00:32:30,400
<i>So many lovely souls</i>
<i>Yet I am made to fall</i>

383
00:32:30,480 --> 00:32:33,720
We're here.

384
00:32:34,720 --> 00:32:36,440
Can you now let go of my hand?

385
00:32:38,160 --> 00:32:40,640
<i>Lastly, tease him a little and see</i>

386
00:32:40,720 --> 00:32:44,840
<i>if he shows any sign of shyness or blush.</i>

387
00:32:44,920 --> 00:32:45,760
Forgive me.

388
00:32:47,040 --> 00:32:49,360
Your hand is soft.

389
00:32:49,440 --> 00:32:50,920
I forgot I was holding it.

390
00:32:52,280 --> 00:32:53,880
I do not wish to let it go.

391
00:32:54,760 --> 00:32:58,800
<i>I broke my back</i>
<i>Preparing dishes in the morning</i>

392
00:32:58,880 --> 00:33:03,720
<i>And I shall taste them</i>
<i>Then call you to the meal</i>

393
00:33:14,160 --> 00:33:18,880
<i>I shall find a woman for my son to wed</i>

394
00:33:18,960 --> 00:33:22,840
<i>For he is burdened with sins</i>
<i>That cannot be saved</i>

395
00:33:22,920 --> 00:33:23,840
Mother!

396
00:33:23,920 --> 00:33:26,800
<i>Cannot be saved</i>

397
00:33:26,880 --> 00:33:30,720
<i>We are fair and virtuous</i>

398
00:33:30,800 --> 00:33:35,160
<i>We are virtuous and fair</i>

399
00:33:35,240 --> 00:33:40,280
<i>In your eyes, I find myself undone</i>

400
00:33:40,360 --> 00:33:45,480
<i>I am captivated by your grace and charm</i>

401
00:33:45,560 --> 00:33:49,320
<i>Your great charm I long to behold</i>

402
00:33:49,400 --> 00:33:52,880
<i>And I wish to be close, held in your arms</i>

403
00:33:54,560 --> 00:33:57,240
<i>Held in your arms</i>

404
00:33:57,320 --> 00:34:01,240
<i>Here you stand, a lonely loner</i>

405
00:34:01,320 --> 00:34:05,480
<i>Here you stand, a lonely loner…</i>

406
00:34:05,560 --> 00:34:09,440
<i>Why are you without your lover, I wonder?</i>

407
00:34:09,520 --> 00:34:10,360
Goodness.

408
00:34:10,440 --> 00:34:12,880
<i>I wonder if his wife…</i>

409
00:34:13,480 --> 00:34:16,600
<i>I wonder if his wife is so charming</i>

410
00:34:16,679 --> 00:34:19,120
<i>That she is all worth keeping</i>

411
00:34:19,199 --> 00:34:23,120
<i>Or are you afraid</i>
<i>That she will be claimed by the dogs?</i>

412
00:34:23,199 --> 00:34:24,280
I am a person.

413
00:34:24,360 --> 00:34:27,080
<i>She will be claimed by the dogs</i>

414
00:34:27,159 --> 00:34:31,639
<i>If you are taken</i>
<i>Then your lady should also be here</i>

415
00:34:31,719 --> 00:34:35,159
<i>Your lady should also be here</i>

416
00:34:35,239 --> 00:34:39,600
<i>But she is not here</i>
<i>So why not have me, my dear?</i>

417
00:34:51,239 --> 00:34:55,360
<i>If you are taken</i>
<i>Then your lady should also be here</i>

418
00:34:58,200 --> 00:35:00,680
I need to use the privy.

419
00:35:01,800 --> 00:35:03,160
I'll be right back.

420
00:35:03,240 --> 00:35:04,560
No need to follow me.

421
00:35:20,840 --> 00:35:23,280
<i>It'd be nice if this were the modern day,</i>

422
00:35:24,360 --> 00:35:26,960
<i>but this is Ayutthaya we're talking about.</i>

423
00:35:27,040 --> 00:35:28,320
<i>Even if we were lovers,</i>

424
00:35:28,960 --> 00:35:30,560
<i>would it be socially acceptable?</i>

425
00:35:45,560 --> 00:35:46,960
<i>I'll let go of this love.</i>

426
00:35:47,040 --> 00:35:48,760
<i>It's the right thing to do.</i>

427
00:35:48,840 --> 00:35:50,000
<i>Focus on the mission.</i>

428
00:35:50,680 --> 00:35:52,400
<i>Find that pond.</i>

429
00:36:26,480 --> 00:36:27,320
Phop.

430
00:36:29,920 --> 00:36:31,000
Cherd!

431
00:36:33,240 --> 00:36:34,760
You need not crowd me so.

432
00:36:34,840 --> 00:36:37,320
I am not interested
in being your lover, Klao.

433
00:36:38,920 --> 00:36:40,400
What the hell are you on about?

434
00:36:43,280 --> 00:36:46,320
Are you pretending not to know,
or haven't you heard the rumors?

435
00:36:47,280 --> 00:36:49,080
There are rumors everywhere that you

436
00:36:49,160 --> 00:36:51,440
and Lord Phop are
engaged in an illicit affair.

437
00:36:51,520 --> 00:36:53,320
Truly shameless.

438
00:36:56,560 --> 00:36:58,320
Why must you be so angry, Klao?

439
00:37:01,680 --> 00:37:04,520
Or are you agitated because
the rumor is true?

440
00:37:15,320 --> 00:37:18,240
It's one thing for you
to be involved with Lord Phop,

441
00:37:18,320 --> 00:37:21,560
but why must you
meddle with my Pim as well?

442
00:37:21,640 --> 00:37:23,120
There!

443
00:37:27,920 --> 00:37:29,240
Hold it right there, Cherd.

444
00:37:31,960 --> 00:37:34,200
I don't see Phop in that light.

445
00:37:47,040 --> 00:37:48,440
Begone from my sight!

446
00:37:57,000 --> 00:37:59,440
Going about drawing your sword
upon the common folk,

447
00:38:00,280 --> 00:38:02,560
is this not an abuse of your authority?

448
00:38:03,240 --> 00:38:05,840
Anyone can tell who started this.

449
00:38:06,920 --> 00:38:09,560
If you wish for no trouble,
begone from my sight.

450
00:38:11,480 --> 00:38:13,240
This is my final warning to you.

451
00:38:22,680 --> 00:38:24,080
Are you well?

452
00:38:24,160 --> 00:38:25,240
Do not meddle with me.

453
00:38:39,040 --> 00:38:40,200
Phop.

454
00:38:40,280 --> 00:38:41,520
I didn't mean to say that.

455
00:38:48,040 --> 00:38:49,000
I know.

456
00:38:50,880 --> 00:38:51,920
Let it be so.

457
00:38:53,360 --> 00:38:54,880
It is a relief to see you safe.

458
00:38:57,360 --> 00:38:58,360
<i>Why is he…</i>

459
00:38:59,040 --> 00:39:00,400
<i>so nice to me?</i>

460
00:39:16,200 --> 00:39:17,520
Your lips are bloodied.

461
00:39:24,040 --> 00:39:25,680
Have you injured your hand?

462
00:39:46,120 --> 00:39:46,960
Ow!

463
00:39:47,880 --> 00:39:49,000
Ouch!

464
00:39:49,640 --> 00:39:50,520
Ow!

465
00:39:51,160 --> 00:39:52,200
Ouch!

466
00:39:52,280 --> 00:39:53,360
Ouch!

467
00:39:57,800 --> 00:39:59,600
-Who are you looking for?
-No one.

468
00:40:00,760 --> 00:40:02,000
Oh, you.

469
00:40:02,080 --> 00:40:05,680
They say you have changed,
as though you were another person,

470
00:40:05,760 --> 00:40:08,000
yet you still get into fights
as you did before.

471
00:40:10,840 --> 00:40:12,000
Don't change the topic.

472
00:40:13,240 --> 00:40:14,440
Kaew isn't coming.

473
00:40:23,320 --> 00:40:24,560
<i>Many thanks to you.</i>

474
00:40:26,480 --> 00:40:28,520
You must be well used to courting others.

475
00:40:28,600 --> 00:40:29,600
No.

476
00:40:30,560 --> 00:40:31,960
I simply…

477
00:40:34,920 --> 00:40:36,760
<i>Ever inquiring after their well-being.</i>

478
00:40:36,840 --> 00:40:39,480
Have there been many patients this day?

479
00:40:39,560 --> 00:40:41,120
Are you weary, Jom?

480
00:40:41,200 --> 00:40:43,400
Alas.

481
00:40:43,480 --> 00:40:44,520
Blood…

482
00:40:46,320 --> 00:40:48,640
<i>Offering your assistance.</i>

483
00:40:50,400 --> 00:40:54,080
<i>Learn what he likes</i>
<i>and simply buy it for him.</i>

484
00:40:54,880 --> 00:40:58,280
<i>I prepared your favorite meal,</i>
<i>hoping we might move past this…</i>

485
00:40:59,120 --> 00:41:00,640
<i>Tease him a little and see</i>

486
00:41:00,720 --> 00:41:03,960
<i>if he shows any sign of shyness or blush.</i>

487
00:41:07,400 --> 00:41:09,040
I merely went by what I have seen.

488
00:41:10,920 --> 00:41:13,440
Is it because
Kaew has done likewise to you?

489
00:41:14,880 --> 00:41:17,440
That is why you know so well
that it works.

490
00:41:19,440 --> 00:41:23,200
Speak not of such things again.
I bear no feelings for him whatsoever.

491
00:41:37,440 --> 00:41:39,200
I know you're worried about him.

492
00:41:39,840 --> 00:41:42,320
You two had a fight yesterday, didn't you?

493
00:41:50,400 --> 00:41:52,480
We're childhood friends, all right?

494
00:41:52,560 --> 00:41:54,240
Say whatever's on your mind.

495
00:41:54,320 --> 00:41:55,840
So we can work out

496
00:41:55,920 --> 00:41:57,800
a solution for Kaew.

497
00:42:00,600 --> 00:42:02,400
It is of no consequence.

498
00:42:03,240 --> 00:42:04,480
I merely rebuked him

499
00:42:04,560 --> 00:42:06,880
for behaving so effeminately,
unbefitting a man.

500
00:42:08,560 --> 00:42:10,720
Kaew was so furious with me
that he cursed me,

501
00:42:10,800 --> 00:42:13,800
vowing never to see me again,
even in the next life.

502
00:42:14,800 --> 00:42:17,080
<i>Do you believe in multiple lifetimes, Pun?</i>

503
00:42:17,160 --> 00:42:18,160
I guess I do.

504
00:42:18,240 --> 00:42:21,800
Perhaps our paths
might have crossed in past lives.

505
00:42:21,880 --> 00:42:23,560
Then I don't believe in it.

506
00:42:23,640 --> 00:42:25,840
This lifetime is more than enough.

507
00:42:31,800 --> 00:42:32,960
But it is for the best.

508
00:42:33,600 --> 00:42:36,160
He will no longer come to trouble me.

509
00:42:37,640 --> 00:42:38,800
Are you sure?

510
00:42:40,800 --> 00:42:42,920
If you really didn't want him
to bother you,

511
00:42:43,000 --> 00:42:45,200
you wouldn't be looking for him like this.

512
00:42:48,080 --> 00:42:50,960
Letting this go on for a day
is already bad.

513
00:42:51,040 --> 00:42:52,640
Don't let this go unresolved

514
00:42:52,720 --> 00:42:54,200
into the next life.

515
00:43:13,680 --> 00:43:16,080
Apply the ointment twice daily
after bathing, Kaew.

516
00:43:18,640 --> 00:43:19,480
Klao.

517
00:43:22,760 --> 00:43:23,600
See?

518
00:43:24,760 --> 00:43:26,200
You miss him, don't you?

519
00:43:26,280 --> 00:43:28,480
Don't deny what your heart tells you.

520
00:43:31,480 --> 00:43:32,840
I know that

521
00:43:32,920 --> 00:43:33,760
you…

522
00:43:34,720 --> 00:43:37,480
You're afraid of being judged by others.

523
00:43:38,760 --> 00:43:40,240
But those who gossip

524
00:43:40,960 --> 00:43:42,400
don't share your sorrow.

525
00:43:45,720 --> 00:43:47,160
Our loved ones

526
00:43:47,240 --> 00:43:48,960
are the most important thing.

527
00:43:49,640 --> 00:43:51,280
If Kaew were heartbroken

528
00:43:51,360 --> 00:43:53,880
and ended his life right now,
what would you do?

529
00:44:17,640 --> 00:44:18,800
Master Klao,

530
00:44:18,880 --> 00:44:21,240
I will prepare
jasmine-scented water for you.

531
00:44:30,240 --> 00:44:31,080
Phop.

532
00:44:31,720 --> 00:44:34,040
I would like to apologize to you again

533
00:44:34,120 --> 00:44:37,040
for saying those things
while I was fighting with Cherd.

534
00:44:38,880 --> 00:44:42,440
I just don't want anyone
to gossip about you.

535
00:44:43,440 --> 00:44:44,440
I know.

536
00:44:45,120 --> 00:44:47,000
But you yourself said that

537
00:44:47,600 --> 00:44:50,400
those who gossip
do not share in our sorrow.

538
00:44:58,000 --> 00:44:59,720
If you care for no one,

539
00:45:00,520 --> 00:45:02,640
would you tell me

540
00:45:03,160 --> 00:45:05,040
how you feel about me?

541
00:45:15,160 --> 00:45:16,520
Master Klao!

542
00:45:17,240 --> 00:45:18,240
Master!

543
00:45:18,320 --> 00:45:19,320
Master Klao.

544
00:45:19,400 --> 00:45:21,720
His Excellency has summoned you.

545
00:45:22,440 --> 00:45:23,920
Does he summon only Dear Klao?

546
00:45:25,280 --> 00:45:26,440
What of me?

547
00:45:26,520 --> 00:45:29,320
You have something
to discuss with me, Lord Phop.

548
00:45:42,360 --> 00:45:44,880
High Lord Soontrapinit came here to see me

549
00:45:47,000 --> 00:45:49,360
to discuss Phop and Lady Varna.

550
00:45:57,320 --> 00:45:59,480
Is it concerning marriage,
Your Excellency?

551
00:46:01,240 --> 00:46:02,080
Yes.

552
00:46:04,320 --> 00:46:06,920
Harn serves in
the same patrol department as Phop.

553
00:46:07,440 --> 00:46:09,000
The High Lord holds a high rank,

554
00:46:09,080 --> 00:46:11,720
which may open the way for you
to enter royal service.

555
00:46:12,400 --> 00:46:14,120
As for Lady Varna,

556
00:46:14,200 --> 00:46:16,360
she is flawless in every way.

557
00:46:17,840 --> 00:46:19,640
Do you not agree?

558
00:46:23,320 --> 00:46:24,160
Yes.

559
00:46:25,600 --> 00:46:27,560
Yet Phop continues to evade the matter,

560
00:46:27,640 --> 00:46:29,560
never allowing me to formally ask her.

561
00:46:30,960 --> 00:46:32,480
You are close to Phop.

562
00:46:33,320 --> 00:46:34,640
Do you know

563
00:46:34,720 --> 00:46:37,320
if he has set his sights upon anyone else?

564
00:46:43,320 --> 00:46:45,120
I…

565
00:46:47,240 --> 00:46:48,680
It seems he does not.

566
00:46:50,040 --> 00:46:50,880
Good.

567
00:46:52,240 --> 00:46:55,040
To let her frequent this house so often

568
00:46:55,640 --> 00:46:58,000
will only lead to gossip and scandal.

569
00:46:58,720 --> 00:47:00,720
Even High Lord Soontrapinit

570
00:47:01,240 --> 00:47:02,960
is far from being at ease with this.

571
00:47:07,080 --> 00:47:09,720
I pray you speak with Phop on my behalf.

572
00:47:12,280 --> 00:47:15,280
I wish to see my son settled

573
00:47:16,040 --> 00:47:18,000
before I no longer have the chance.

574
00:47:24,520 --> 00:47:25,520
Yes, Your Excellency.

575
00:47:46,440 --> 00:47:48,520
The soldiers captured the smugglers

576
00:47:48,600 --> 00:47:51,440
who carried opium
from the capital to sell in Sam Khok.

577
00:47:52,440 --> 00:47:55,160
My father conducted
the interrogation himself,

578
00:47:56,120 --> 00:47:58,080
yet none of them would confess.

579
00:48:00,400 --> 00:48:02,520
The market district under your supervision

580
00:48:03,040 --> 00:48:05,120
also has many opium smokers?

581
00:48:08,960 --> 00:48:09,800
Yes.

582
00:48:13,040 --> 00:48:15,520
And Klao shall return there
once more.

583
00:48:18,120 --> 00:48:18,960
Lord Phop,

584
00:48:20,360 --> 00:48:23,080
did you know that
just before the New Year,

585
00:48:23,160 --> 00:48:26,040
Klao went to visit
a prostitute by the name of Pim?

586
00:48:26,720 --> 00:48:28,960
He ended up in a brawl with Cherd.

587
00:48:31,720 --> 00:48:35,040
The locals are abuzz with rumors
that they are fighting over her.

588
00:48:36,360 --> 00:48:38,080
It would seem your brother

589
00:48:38,160 --> 00:48:40,640
has truly fallen in love with
the young lady,

590
00:48:41,280 --> 00:48:44,360
beyond mere physical desire, Lord Phop.

591
00:48:51,400 --> 00:48:52,240
My Lord!

592
00:48:52,320 --> 00:48:54,320
My Lord! My Lord.

593
00:48:56,080 --> 00:48:57,600
Master Klao is missing.

594
00:48:58,520 --> 00:48:59,800
How so?

595
00:48:59,880 --> 00:49:01,280
When did he go missing?

596
00:49:01,360 --> 00:49:02,720
I am not certain, my Lord.

597
00:49:02,800 --> 00:49:05,240
He was speaking with
His Excellency one moment,

598
00:49:05,320 --> 00:49:07,240
and the next,

599
00:49:07,320 --> 00:49:08,720
Master Klao was gone.

600
00:49:09,640 --> 00:49:10,600
I knew it.

601
00:49:12,080 --> 00:49:14,040
I am certain he has gone to seek out Pim.

602
00:49:16,120 --> 00:49:18,640
I am greatly concerned
for your brother, Lord Phop.

603
00:50:08,200 --> 00:50:09,240
Kaew.

604
00:50:12,480 --> 00:50:13,680
I pray you, come out.

605
00:50:16,400 --> 00:50:19,080
The servants said
you have yet to eat anything all day.

606
00:50:27,440 --> 00:50:28,280
I…

607
00:50:33,960 --> 00:50:35,640
I have brought your favorites.

608
00:51:17,760 --> 00:51:18,840
Pray, just go.

609
00:51:21,160 --> 00:51:22,840
If you hold no affection for me,

610
00:51:24,320 --> 00:51:25,680
then come not near me again.

611
00:51:31,040 --> 00:51:33,640
I pray you,
come out and speak with me, Kaew.

612
00:51:35,000 --> 00:51:36,120
I am worried for you.

613
00:52:05,680 --> 00:52:06,520
No.

614
00:52:10,080 --> 00:52:11,080
Pray, leave.

615
00:52:12,280 --> 00:52:14,880
We have nothing further
to say to each other.

616
00:52:28,640 --> 00:52:29,720
I shall wait

617
00:52:33,960 --> 00:52:35,400
until your anger abates.

618
00:53:40,600 --> 00:53:43,040
<i>Why is it that whenever I'm not at ease,</i>

619
00:53:43,120 --> 00:53:45,000
<i>my heart tells me to come here?</i>

620
00:53:49,120 --> 00:53:50,960
<i>The more I pretend to be Klao,</i>

621
00:53:52,320 --> 00:53:54,360
<i>the more I feel like I'm actually him.</i>

622
00:53:57,920 --> 00:53:59,760
I knew you would be here.

623
00:54:08,000 --> 00:54:10,000
You've been gone until nightfall.

624
00:54:11,000 --> 00:54:14,320
People believed you had gone to
the House of Pleasure again.

625
00:54:20,920 --> 00:54:22,360
Lord Harn told you that?

626
00:54:25,360 --> 00:54:26,600
The last time,

627
00:54:27,280 --> 00:54:29,200
he met me while I was with Cherd.

628
00:54:30,840 --> 00:54:33,160
I am certain you will not return there.

629
00:54:35,400 --> 00:54:38,040
I believe I know you, my Klao,
well enough.

630
00:54:58,040 --> 00:54:59,800
Is something troubling you?

631
00:55:01,240 --> 00:55:03,680
Chuay told me that
you went to speak with my father.

632
00:55:10,440 --> 00:55:11,280
I did.

633
00:55:12,960 --> 00:55:14,520
I did speak with him.

634
00:55:17,040 --> 00:55:20,600
He wants you to get married.

635
00:55:24,200 --> 00:55:26,520
He's already pretty old.

636
00:55:27,600 --> 00:55:29,120
As for you, Phop,

637
00:55:30,840 --> 00:55:32,960
you've come of age.

638
00:55:34,840 --> 00:55:37,040
If there's nothing that troubles you,

639
00:55:40,840 --> 00:55:42,440
then go ahead and tell him.

640
00:55:57,040 --> 00:55:57,880
Klao,

641
00:55:58,720 --> 00:56:00,480
if I am to be wed,

642
00:56:01,000 --> 00:56:03,000
it shall certainly not be to Lady Varna.

643
00:56:09,960 --> 00:56:12,040
I could never share my life with anyone

644
00:56:13,920 --> 00:56:15,120
but you.

645
00:56:33,600 --> 00:56:36,200
I cannot even say when it began,

646
00:56:38,280 --> 00:56:41,120
but right now,
all I know is that I wish to be with you,

647
00:56:44,760 --> 00:56:48,280
to care for you,
and to stay by your side forever.

648
00:56:57,320 --> 00:56:58,560
There is neither liquor

649
00:56:59,480 --> 00:57:01,280
nor fermented palm sugar drink here.

650
00:57:03,400 --> 00:57:06,080
Everything I am about to say to you

651
00:57:08,040 --> 00:57:10,480
comes purely from the depths of my heart.

652
00:57:15,880 --> 00:57:18,720
I no longer look upon you
as my younger brother,

653
00:57:21,720 --> 00:57:23,600
but as the man

654
00:57:28,560 --> 00:57:32,160
with whom
I wish to spend the rest of my life.

655
00:57:41,440 --> 00:57:43,280
Is that clear enough for you, Klao?

656
00:58:16,520 --> 00:58:19,800
This kiss is meant to convey
the love I hold for you.

657
00:58:21,480 --> 00:58:24,200
Let me assure you once again…

658
00:58:27,240 --> 00:58:28,280
I love you

659
00:58:29,680 --> 00:58:31,000
with all my heart.

660
00:58:35,520 --> 00:58:37,080
What do you say, Dear Klao?

661
00:58:40,000 --> 00:58:41,880
How do you feel about me?

662
00:58:48,440 --> 00:58:49,280
Phop.

663
00:58:52,080 --> 00:58:52,920
That was a kiss?

664
00:58:53,520 --> 00:58:55,360
Let me show you how it's done.

665
01:00:34,880 --> 01:00:36,160
What is the matter?

666
01:00:39,400 --> 01:00:40,440
Why are you in tears?

667
01:00:42,600 --> 01:00:44,480
You also love me, do you not?

668
01:00:47,840 --> 01:00:49,000
I do.

669
01:00:49,080 --> 01:00:49,920
Phop.

670
01:00:50,840 --> 01:00:52,000
I do love you,

671
01:00:54,240 --> 01:00:55,080
but

672
01:00:56,160 --> 01:00:57,960
love alone isn't enough.

673
01:01:14,280 --> 01:01:16,840
You're a lord.

674
01:01:18,160 --> 01:01:19,400
You're in the patrol unit.

675
01:01:21,920 --> 01:01:22,880
Just today alone,

676
01:01:24,760 --> 01:01:26,880
everyone was already staring at us.

677
01:01:28,440 --> 01:01:29,520
I care not.

678
01:01:31,240 --> 01:01:32,240
You said that--

679
01:01:32,320 --> 01:01:34,320
You should care.

680
01:01:38,480 --> 01:01:40,600
If this were the place I came from,

681
01:01:40,680 --> 01:01:42,080
I would've feared nothing.

682
01:01:44,600 --> 01:01:46,320
But here, it's different.

683
01:01:48,240 --> 01:01:50,440
How would you live your life like this?

684
01:01:58,240 --> 01:01:59,200
Let us go

685
01:02:00,760 --> 01:02:03,600
to a place where we may express our love.

686
01:02:05,920 --> 01:02:07,000
Phop.

687
01:02:08,080 --> 01:02:09,800
How would that be possible, Phop?

688
01:02:11,600 --> 01:02:13,000
What about your father?

689
01:02:14,360 --> 01:02:15,520
What about your mother?

690
01:02:17,880 --> 01:02:18,800
Regardless,

691
01:02:19,800 --> 01:02:22,160
you'll end up marrying Lady Varna.

692
01:02:23,040 --> 01:02:24,360
It's the best option.

693
01:02:31,800 --> 01:02:32,800
You…

694
01:02:35,000 --> 01:02:37,160
Do you truly wish for me
to be wed so badly?

695
01:02:42,320 --> 01:02:43,160
Yes.

696
01:02:45,760 --> 01:02:47,480
Your parents

697
01:02:48,160 --> 01:02:49,240
and I

698
01:02:50,680 --> 01:02:52,360
really wish for you to get married.

699
01:02:55,280 --> 01:02:57,160
Once you have settled down,

700
01:02:58,440 --> 01:03:00,000
I'd be extremely delighted.

701
01:03:37,520 --> 01:03:38,360
My Phop.

702
01:03:39,840 --> 01:03:40,800
I'm terribly sorry.

703
01:03:44,360 --> 01:03:46,280
I pray you, let go of this love.

704
01:03:48,440 --> 01:03:50,720
It's best we're brothers.

705
01:03:54,360 --> 01:03:56,440
I beg you to understand me.

706
01:04:12,880 --> 01:04:13,960
I understand.

707
01:04:24,320 --> 01:04:25,640
Your lantern has gone out.

708
01:04:27,480 --> 01:04:28,320
Come with me,

709
01:04:29,080 --> 01:04:30,280
I shall guide you.

710
01:04:44,520 --> 01:04:45,840
<i>He's being nice again.</i>

711
01:04:46,840 --> 01:04:50,040
<i>Just walking away from me</i>
<i>shouldn't hurt me this deeply.</i>

712
01:04:52,560 --> 01:04:54,000
<i>If there is a next life,</i>

713
01:04:55,040 --> 01:04:56,640
<i>I hope we'll meet again</i>

714
01:04:57,320 --> 01:04:59,520
<i>in a world where men</i>
<i>can fall in love freely.</i>

715
01:05:05,280 --> 01:05:06,120
Yeah.

716
01:05:37,280 --> 01:05:39,360
<i>You did the right thing, Nakun.</i>

717
01:05:39,440 --> 01:05:41,920
<i>Even if he didn't get married</i>
<i>to Lady Varna…</i>

718
01:05:43,400 --> 01:05:45,720
<i>If he found out I wasn't the real Klao,</i>

719
01:05:46,840 --> 01:05:48,400
<i>he'd be in deep sorrow.</i>

720
01:06:11,680 --> 01:06:12,680
<i>I wonder</i>

721
01:06:13,560 --> 01:06:15,320
<i>how heartbroken he feels.</i>

722
01:06:39,040 --> 01:06:40,160
Make haste.

723
01:08:02,400 --> 01:08:03,240
<i>I…</i>

724
01:08:04,080 --> 01:08:05,560
<i>I offer this prayer…</i>

725
01:08:11,720 --> 01:08:12,760
There.

726
01:08:12,840 --> 01:08:15,680
That's what Rattikan,
the fortune teller, said.

727
01:08:15,760 --> 01:08:16,840
<i>"Rattikan"</i>

728
01:08:16,920 --> 01:08:18,600
<i>isn't just her name.</i>

729
01:08:18,680 --> 01:08:20,120
<i>The name means nighttime.</i>

730
01:08:20,800 --> 01:08:21,640
<i>Cold.</i>

731
01:08:22,359 --> 01:08:25,680
<i>He was suffocating</i>
<i>because he was weighed down underwater.</i>

732
01:08:25,760 --> 01:08:27,640
<i>Cherd stabbed me in a hut</i>

733
01:08:28,680 --> 01:08:30,319
<i>and threw me into the water.</i>

734
01:08:41,880 --> 01:08:44,600
<i>So this writing refers to</i>
<i>the incident at the hut?</i>

735
01:08:44,680 --> 01:08:46,279
<i>What about the temple?</i>

736
01:08:46,359 --> 01:08:47,560
<i>What does it mean?</i>

737
01:08:55,000 --> 01:08:56,520
<i>The point of reference.</i>

738
01:08:56,600 --> 01:08:59,520
<i>Do I enter the woods by the temple</i>
<i>to find the hut?</i>

739
01:09:04,920 --> 01:09:05,840
<i>Which temple is it?</i>

740
01:09:06,840 --> 01:09:08,840
<i>Is it the same one I visited today?</i>

741
01:09:08,920 --> 01:09:11,960
<i>That's why Cherd and his men were</i>
<i>waiting for me.</i>

742
01:10:49,640 --> 01:10:50,480
Oh, Jom!

743
01:10:50,560 --> 01:10:52,880
You spent all night
waiting in front of his room.

744
01:10:52,960 --> 01:10:55,800
<i>I hear that Kaew is moving</i>
<i>to another city.</i>

745
01:10:58,560 --> 01:11:01,680
The reason I had to get close to Cherd
was that…

746
01:11:01,760 --> 01:11:03,320
You are suspicious of him?

747
01:11:03,400 --> 01:11:04,800
Pray tell me,

748
01:11:04,880 --> 01:11:07,000
Cherd has involved
in the opium trade.

749
01:11:07,080 --> 01:11:08,120
<i>My Lord!</i>

750
01:11:08,200 --> 01:11:10,480
The patrol seized enough opium
to fill a cart.

751
01:11:10,560 --> 01:11:14,400
Lord Harn, there is a chance
we may trace this back to those behind it.

752
01:11:14,480 --> 01:11:15,480
I beg of you.

753
01:11:15,560 --> 01:11:17,880
<i>If Lord Phop discovers</i>
<i>we've been trailing him,</i>

754
01:11:17,960 --> 01:11:19,320
I shall surely lose my head.

755
01:11:23,000 --> 01:11:25,240
<i>You may scold or chastise me as you will.</i>

756
01:11:26,600 --> 01:11:28,640
<i>I'm relieved you made it out alive.</i>
